lm curves is now implemented.  This is accessed through the Curve menu when the Film tab is active. Any approximated curves are saved in the Matcher document. All approximations are well, just approximations of curves and the G or SBR might not match exac
tly but it should be close (at least as close as the old DOS Matcher).
\par {\pntext\pard\plain\f3\fs20\insrsid15686259 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}}\pard \ql \fi-720\li1440\ri0\nowidctlpar{\*\pn \pnlvlblt\ilvl0\ls1\pnrnot0\pnf3 {\pntxtb \'b7}}\faauto\ls1\rin0\lin1440\itap0\pararsid11218955 {\fs20\insrsid15686259 
